  "notes": "{探査|たんさ} means systematic investigation or exploration, especially of unknown or hard-to-reach places. Composed of {探|たん} (search) + {査|さ} (investigate).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{宇宙|うちゅう}→宇宙：01861_uchuu⟧{探査|たんさ}: space exploration\n- ⟦{火星|かせい}→火星：13412_kasei⟧{探査|たんさ}: Mars exploration\n- ⟦{月|つき}→月：02230_tsuki⟧{探査|たんさ}: lunar exploration\n- ⟦{深海|しんかい}→深海：16050_shinkai⟧{探査|たんさ}: deep-sea exploration\n- {探査|たんさ}⟦{機|き}→〜機：09843_ki⟧: probe (spacecraft/robot)\n- {探査|たんさ}⟦{船|せん}→船：09875_sen⟧: exploration vessel\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{探検|たんけん}→探検：17461_tanken⟧: exploration (adventure-style, human-led)\n- ⟦{調査|ちょうさ}→調査：03489_chousa⟧: investigation, survey (broader, includes data collection)\n- ⟦{捜索|そうさく}→捜索：19220_sousaku⟧: search (for missing persons or objects)",
